title: 'Linked mods: pin and re-approve on change'
summary: Founder chose the trust model for folder-linked mods.
symbols_touched:
  - '#paradigm-harness'
decisions:
  - id: P8-D53
    decision: '`gnomon mod link <folder>` raises an install card showing the mod''s declared effects, then pins the folder''s package hash. Any change (an edit or a git pull) pauses the mod and raises a short re-approve card listing the changed files. Mods you are authoring may use a dev mode that re-pins on save, shown with a visible ''dev'' badge.'
    rationale: A linked folder is live code; changes must never load silently.
